<%- include('../partials/page-hero', {
  heading: 'Quality, Health and Safety',
  intro: 'WetomTech treats quality management, environmental responsibility and safe field practice as essential parts of technical performance.'
}) %>

<section class="section quality-intro-section">
  <div class="container quality-intro-grid">
    <div class="quality-statement reveal">
      <p class="section-label light">Quality statement</p>
      <h2>Client satisfaction is engineered, measured and improved.</h2>
      <p>
        WetomTech commits to professional requirements, applicable regulations and internal quality controls. Responsibilities are defined, work is inspected and outcomes are reviewed so that each project contributes to stronger processes and better service delivery.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="quality-principles reveal" data-delay="100">
      <div><span>01</span><strong>Defined responsibility</strong><p>Clear ownership across management, engineering, supervision and field execution.</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><strong>Client focus</strong><p>Solutions are evaluated against the customer’s actual operational need.</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><strong>Continuous improvement</strong><p>Lessons, feedback and technical results are used to improve future delivery.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section safety-feature-section">
  <div class="container safety-feature-grid">
    <div class="safety-feature-image reveal"><img src="/images/solar-installation.jpg" alt="Technicians working on a solar installation" loading="lazy" /></div>
    <div class="safety-feature-copy reveal" data-delay="100">
      <p class="section-label">Environment, health and safety</p>
      <h2>Safe work requires preparation, attention and the right tools.</h2>
      <p>
        Worksites, workers, tools and the surrounding environment are assessed before and during operations. WetomTech promotes training, appropriate equipment, safe procedures and active supervision to reduce preventable risks.
      </p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span>✓</span>Pre-work site and task risk assessment</li>
        <li><span>✓</span>Appropriate personal protective equipment</li>
        <li><span>✓</span>Safe tools, access systems and work procedures</li>
        <li><span>✓</span>Incident prevention and field supervision</li>
        <li><span>✓</span>Environmental protection and responsible site conduct</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section training-csr-section">
  <div class="container training-csr-grid">
    <article class="training-card reveal">
      <div class="service-icon large"><%- include('../partials/icon', { icon: 'people' }) %></div>
      <p class="section-label">Training</p>
      <h2>Competence is maintained through continuous development.</h2>
      <p>
        WetomTech invests in practical employee training, role-based assessment and ongoing skills development so that technical personnel can respond efficiently to changing field requirements.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="csr-card reveal" data-delay="100">
      <p class="section-label light">Corporate social responsibility</p>
      <h2>Business should create value beyond the immediate project.</h2>
      <p>
        Social responsibility is treated as part of the company’s strategy. Community-focused initiatives are considered according to social need, economic value and the opportunity to improve skills, development and local participation.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section governance-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading centered reveal"><p class="section-label">Operational controls</p><h2>A practical framework for responsible execution.</h2></div>
    <div class="governance-grid">
      <div class="reveal"><span>Plan</span><strong>Scope, risks and controls</strong><p>Project requirements and site risks are identified before work begins.</p></div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="70"><span>Execute</span><strong>Qualified supervision</strong><p>Work is performed by personnel with defined technical and safety responsibilities.</p></div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="140"><span>Verify</span><strong>Inspection and testing</strong><p>Installed systems are checked against expected quality and performance standards.</p></div>
      <div class="reveal" data-delay="210"><span>Improve</span><strong>Feedback and learning</strong><p>Results and client feedback inform corrective action and continuous improvement.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
